{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t第五屆亞洲殘疾人運動會煞科日，港隊在女子佩劍團體賽獲得一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n由余翠怡、林嘉雯、湯雅婷、鍾婉萍組成的港隊，在決賽以16：30不敵國家隊。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n劍擊隊在今屆賽事已取得3銀4銅。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:24.901200+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:07:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:37.977952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:23.081872+00:00","content_hash":"d739dbf417830757d408a84617fc61341de5c9170b63d78bfdb449b7b59a9776","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}